                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "113754cd-f122-3dbe-899d-f7675a369fdf",
                                        "entry_id": "17d984a7-8ca2-3779-aae0-e05ba19da7e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "time spent in nature, in a garden or greenspace, as a health benefit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3516e642-d9f5-4d6b-84df-c9a9e6dc0cdb",
                                                "sense_id": "113754cd-f122-3dbe-899d-f7675a369fdf",
                                                "text": "2006 June 7, Peter P Groenewegen, Agnes E van den Berg, Sjerp de Vries3 and Robert A Verheij \"Vitamin G: effects of green space on health, well-being, and social\" BMC Public Health vol. 6 no. 149 →DOI\nThe briefest summary of our program is in its title: Vitamin G, where G stands for the green space around us. Notions of beneficial effects of nearby green space have persisted throughout history."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25818b73-4566-45bb-8c00-dd6a543a3bcb",
                                                "sense_id": "113754cd-f122-3dbe-899d-f7675a369fdf",
                                                "text": "There are dozens of ways to connect with nature, and you don’t even need to have your own garden to get your Vitamin G."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "527f3be6-4138-39c0-9b18-d6e22b568985",
                                        "entry_id": "17d984a7-8ca2-3779-aae0-e05ba19da7e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Guinness stout"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "humorous",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd8aac61-9b60-4c5a-a494-ab964bd029dd",
                                                "sense_id": "527f3be6-4138-39c0-9b18-d6e22b568985",
                                                "text": "With Krissy Harris (former head bartender at Gramercy Tavern) overseeing the bar program, drinkers may be tempted to set Guinness aside for cocktails ... Of course, Vitamin G loyalists can still find the stuff on tap"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f926f53a-2c47-403e-a273-3a8df1a738fe",
                                                "sense_id": "527f3be6-4138-39c0-9b18-d6e22b568985",
                                                "text": "...a pint of Guinness at the Cheltenham Festival costs a mind-boggling £7.50. That makes it one of the most expensive pints of \"Vitamin G\", as it's dubbed, in the world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
